    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Greetings, \n\nI am HON. DESART JEAN-PIERRE working with ORABANK S.A.
    TOGO as their GENERAL FOREIGN REMITTANCE DEPT. Also as an account officer to
    late Engineer George. I Hope that you will not expose or betray this trust and
    confidence that I am about to repose to you for the mutual benefit of both our
    families. I have a very confidental business proposition for you. There is a
    sum of (US$9.6 milion) floating in our bank uncarried, belonging to the bank
    Foreign customer my client late Engineer George who died with his family in the
    Ethiopian Airline crash on the 11th March 2019.\n\nI am his personal account
    officer with the account he has with our bank. My purpouse of contacting you
    is that my late client , late Engineer George, deposited these funds valued at
    (US$9.6 million) with our bank before his death without an heir apparent, NEXT
    OF KIN or BENEFICIARY. However, I would like to present you to our bank as the
    NEXT OF KIN to late Engineer George in order to lay claim to the aforementioned
    funds.\n\nI solicit your cooperation and assistance for this, I need your urgent
    assiatance in transferring the US$9.6 MIllion) to your account within 10 or 14
    banking working days. This money has been dormant since last year in his account
    with our bank without claim. Our bank will relase the money to you as the nearest
    person to our deseased customer and I don't want the money to go into the government
    treasury as an abandoned fun. So this is the reason why I am contacting you so
    that our bank can release the funds to you as the NEXT OF KIN to the deseased
    customer late Engineer George since you share the same surname with him.\n\nPlease
    I would like you to keep this proposal as a top and delete it if you are not
    interested. Upon receipt of your reply, I will give you full details on how the
    business will be executed and also note that you will have 50% of the above mentioned
    sum while 50% will be for me, if you agree to handle this business with me. I
    am expecting your urgent response.\n\nPlease advise that the confidentiality
    of this transaction is non-negotiable."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
